#. translators: please keep %1$s and %2$s in the translated version
#: includes/settings/class-cr-settings-referrals.php:55
msgid "Referral marketing is one of the most cost-effective ways to acquire new customers. It is based on the idea that your current customers will spread the word about your store and bring in (or refer) new customers. The problem is that it is not easy for them to do so. We help your customers to spread the word by showing their public reviews to other customers at %1$scusrev.com%2$s."
msgstr "Le marketing de recommandation est l‘un des moyens les plus rentables d‘acquérir de nouvelles nouveaux clients. Il repose sur l‘idée que vos clients/clientes actuels feront connaître votre boutique et vous amèneront (ou vous recommanderont) de nouvelles personnes. Le problème est qu‘il n‘est pas facile pour eux de le faire. Nous aidons vos clients et clientes à faire passer le mot en affichant leurs avis publics à d‘autres internautes sur %1$scusrev.com%2$s."

